    "result_text": "Full suite is green: **261 tests, 0 failures, 0 errors, BUILD SUCCESS**.\n\n## What I did\n\nThe `POST /api/owners` endpoint needed to emit an audit line to the `AUDIT` logger on successful create, carrying the owner id, `customerCode` and `registrationDate`.\n\nFollowing the OfficeFloor function-injection conventions in AGENTS.md, I:\n\n1. **Added a new step function** \u2014 `AuditOwnerCreated.java`. It reads the persisted owner via `@Val Owner` and logs to `LoggerFactory.getLogger(\"AUDIT\")`:\n   ```\n   AUDIT - owner created id=11 customerCode=TOW-SUR-0001 registrationDate=2026-08-10\n   ```\n\n2. **Wired it into the pipeline** in `owners.POST.yml`, inserting an `audit` step between `save` and `respond` (under the same `transaction` governance). It runs *after* `save` so the owner id is assigned, and before responding.\n\nThe values are logged verbatim \u2014 the id, the raw `customerCode` string, and the `LocalDate.toString()` (ISO `yyyy-MM-dd`), which matches the JSON `registrationDate` the acceptance test compares against. The `AcceptanceTest.coreLogsAuditOnCreate` test and all 261 tests pass.",
